nteger\n\nThe amount to be captured in cents.\n\n**Example:** For 75 EGP capture, send 7500 (75.00 × 100)\n\n**Validation:**\n\n- Must be less than or equal to the authorized amount\n    \n- For partial captures, must be a positive integer\n    \n\n**JSON**\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"amount_cents\": 7500\n}\n\n ```\n\n**Capture Types:**\n\n- **Full Capture:** Set `amount_cents` equal to the original authorized amount.\n    \n- **Partial Capture:** Set `amount_cents` to any amount less than the authorized amount."
